.SH NAME
bpchat \- Bundle Protocol chat test program
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBbpchat\fR \fIsourceEID\fR \fIdestEID\fR [ct]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBbpchat\fR uses Bundle Protocol to send input text in bundles, and display the
payload of received bundles as output.  It is similar to the \fBtalk\fR utility,
but operates over the Bundle Protocol.  It operates like a combination of the
\&\fBbpsource\fR and \fBbpsink\fR utilities in one program (unlike \fBbpsource\fR, 
\&\fBbpchat\fR emits bundles with a \fIsourceEID\fR).
.PP
If the \fIsourceEID\fR and \fIdestEID\fR are both \fBbpchat\fR applications, then two
users can chat with each other over the Bundle Protocol: lines that one user
types on the keyboard will be transported over the network in bundles and
displayed on the screen of the other user (and the reverse).
.PP
\&\fBbpchat\fR terminates upon receiving the SIGQUIT signal, i.e., ^C from the
keyboard.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.IX Header "EXIT STATUS"
.IP """0""" 4
.IX Item """0"""
\&\fBbpchat\fR has terminated normally.  Any problems encountered during operation
will be noted in the \fBion.log\fR log file.
.IP """1""" 4
.IX Item """1"""
\&\fBbpchat\fR has terminated due to a BP transmit or reception failure.  Details
should be noted in the \fBion.log\fR log file.
.SH OPTIONS
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP [ct] 4
.IX Item "[ct]"
If the string "ct" is appended as the last argument, then bundles will be sent
with custody transfer requested.
.SH FILES
.IX Header "FILES"
No configuration files are needed.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.IX Header "ENVIRONMENT"
No environment variables apply.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
.IX Header "DIAGNOSTICS"
Diagnostic messages produced by \fBbpchat\fR are written to the ION log
file \fIion.log\fR.
.IP "Can't attach to BP." 4
.IX Item "Can't attach to BP."
\&\fBbpadmin\fR has not yet initialized Bundle Protocol operations.
.IP "Can't open own endpoint." 4
.IX Item "Can't open own endpoint."
Another application has already opened \fIownEndpointId\fR.  Terminate that
application and rerun.
.IP "bpchat bundle reception failed." 4
.IX Item "bpchat bundle reception failed."
BP system error.  Check for earlier diagnostic messages describing
the cause of the error; correct problem and rerun.
.IP "No space for ZCO extent." 4
.IX Item "No space for ZCO extent."
ION system error.  Check for earlier diagnostic messages describing
the cause of the error; correct problem and rerun.
.IP "Can't create ZCO." 4
.IX Item "Can't create ZCO."
ION system error.  Check for earlier diagnostic messages describing
the cause of the error; correct problem and rerun.
.IP "bpchat can't send echo bundle." 4
.IX Item "bpchat can't send echo bundle."
BP system error.  Check for earlier diagnostic messages describing
the cause of the error; correct problem and rerun.
